--- !u!114 &1871342437
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1871342435}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 3


    The air runs out. Every time.

    I wake up on the floor and
    the

    room has moved on without me.


    The fire kept burning while

    I
    was gone.


    USE IT.'
--- !u!23 &1871342438
